description	"Starkiller

^2Weaponry:
- Galen's Dual Lightsabers
-- ^2Dual ^7Style Only
-- Saber / Blaster Defense (1)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Sense (1)
- Lightning (3)
- Repulse ^5[CS1 Melee]

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (3)

^3Abilities:
- Dash (1)

After the death of Marek, Vader endeavored to create a more powerful and obedient version of his fallen disciple, using a cloning facility on the planet Kamino to carry out this agenda. Starkiller was affected by the emotional imprints that he inherited from his template and consequently developed a fixation on Captain Juno Eclipse, a former Imperial officer whom Marek fell in love with. Dismissed by his master as another setback in a long line of failures, the clone fled from Kamino and began traveling across the galaxy to find Eclipse."